          "end": 100.89,
          "en": "we can of course also use ChatGPT as employers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 100.89,
          "end": 104.00999999999999,
          "en": "This means if we have to write a job offer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 104.00999999999999,
          "end": 106.208,
          "en": "for a new position in our company,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 106.208,
          "end": 109.74000000000001,
          "en": "ChatGPT can help us to do this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 109.74000000000001,
          "end": 113.72999999999999,
          "en": "We only have to provide the core facts of the offer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 113.72999999999999,
          "end": 116.64,
          "en": "working hours, topic, salary, et cetera,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 116.64,
          "end": 120.99,
          "en": "and then ChatGPT should come up at least with a great draft",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 120.99,
          "end": 123.18,
          "en": "that we can build on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 123.18,
          "end": 125.25,
          "en": "Once we've found the right candidate,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 125.25,
          "end": 129.216,
          "en": "we can also use ChatGPT to write contracts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 129.216,
          "end": 131.67,
          "en": "Here we have to be careful though",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 131.67,
          "end": 135.75,
          "en": "because obviously ChatGPT is not a human being,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 135.75,
          "end": 138.24,
          "en": "and therefore it's not a lawyer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 138.24,
          "end": 141.81,
          "en": "So this contract part is something I want to show you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 141.81,
          "end": 145.727,
          "en": "but still the law side is something you have to be aware of",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 145.727,
          "end": 149.109,
